Package: spbalRef
Type: Package
Title: Cache bounding boxes and seeds for existing mastersamples to use in spbal and convenience functions for 2 stage sampling
Version: 0.2.0
Author: Ollie Gansell
Maintainer: Ollie Gansell <ogansell@doc.govt.nz>
Description: This package is for mastersamples built on package spbal. It can be used to cache bounding boxes and seeds for existing mastersamples and host convenience functions to pass to spbal. Includes functionality for creating two-stage spatial sampling designs with optimized primary sampling units (PSUs).
License: GPL-2
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
Imports: 
    dplyr,
    sf,
    spsurvey,
    anticlust,
    dismo,
    tidyr,
    tibble,
    stringr,
    rlang
Suggests:
    usethis,
    ggplot2,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/ogansell/spbalRef
BugReports: https://github.com/ogansell/spbalRef/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
